  "custom_logic_notes": "WOC (Wave Oscillator Confluence) uses multi-indicator confluence: EMA crossover as primary trend direction, RSI as momentum confirmation (oversold/overbought thresholds), MACD as secondary trend filter. Entry requires all three conditions aligned. Signal reversal closes existing opposite position before opening new one. Digit adjustment applied to SL/TP for 5-digit brokers (multiplied by 10). Position sizing is dual-mode: negative input = fixed lots, positive input = percentage of free margin.",
