  "backtest_data_needs": "M1",
  "python_conversion_notes": "1. Digit adjustment: check if symbol has 5 digits (_Digits==5 or _Point<0.001) and multiply SL/TP by 10 accordingly. 2. New bar detection: track bar time to ensure one signal per bar. 3. Position sizing dual-mode: if lots_param < 0, use abs(lots_param) as fixed lots; if lots_param > 0, calculate lot size as (free_margin * lots_param / 100) / (contract_size * price). 4. Close opposite position before opening new one on signal reversal. 5. All indicators are standard TA-Lib equivalents - straightforward mapping. 6. Use pandas_ta or ta library for indicator calculations in Python.",
